+- Decrease `pending_inbound_connections` on `FromSwarm::ListenFailure` and `pending_outbound_connections` on `FromSwarm::DialFailure`.
+
+  See [PR 4250].
+
+[PR 4250]: https://github.com/libp2p/rust-libp2p/pull/4250
